OL,3,ATrump's AI rebrand causes
OL,4,A'unprecedented' demand for Slovenian
OL,5,Awebsite names
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump's push to rename AI may be
OL,8,Fbehind an "unprecedented" rise in
OL,9,Fregistrations for domain names in
OL,10,FSlovenia, according to its official
OL,11,Fnational registry.
OL,13,FThe US president wants AI to be called
OL,14,F"super intelligence" - or SI - the same
OL,15,Finitials used by Slovenian websites.
OL,17,FRegister.si spokeswoman Klara Herman
OL,18,Fsaid 44,000 web addresses with the.si
OL,19,Fsuffix had been registered in
OL,20,FSeptember, compared to less than 2,000
OL,21,Fin August - an increase of more than
OL,22,F2,100%.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
