OL,3,AWatch: Moment Esther Rantzen reunites
OL,4,Aman with children he saved from Nazi
OL,5,Aoccupation
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther Rantzen, who has died at
OL,8,Fthe age of 86, will perhaps be best
OL,9,Fremembered for presenting the BBC
OL,10,Fseries That's Life! While the programme
OL,11,Fran for two decades, one episode in
OL,12,Fparticular stands out for many.
OL,14,FShe presented the hugely popular BBC
OL,15,FOne show from 1973 to 1994, drawing in
OL,16,Fhuge audiences.
OL,18,FOne of Dame Esther's most memorable
OL,19,Fcareer moments came during an episode
OL,20,Fin 1988 - the footage of which has gone
OL,21,Fviral several times over in recent
OL,22,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
